out\n- `src/components/report/visualizations/SourceNetwork.tsx` - Use shared layout\n- `src/components/visualizations/RadarView.tsx` - Use shared layout for node positioning\n- Create new `src/lib/layout/` directory with layout algorithms\n\n## Success Criteria\n- [ ] Single source of truth for force-directed layout logic\n- [ ] All three network visualizations use shared layout engine\n- [ ] Layout parameters are configurable per-component\n- [ ] Performance is equal or better than current implementations\n\n## Potential Challenges\n- Different visualizations have slightly different requirements - make engine flexible\n- Animation during layout updates needs careful handling to avoid jank\nDIRECTION_EOF\necho \"Direction 2 content written\"","description":"Write direction 2 content to temp file"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":362,"cache_read_input_tokens":85092,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":362},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"86fbfc1a-4772-433d-bdd8-8a7ad125f24a","uuid":"054814d8-4d14-4b52-9ab3-e7839e77d05f"}
