[2026-01-30T14:14:10.876Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01FXxNyhvaqsTSuFn4wxtDbc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CpioMcLzMHYp5rF5z2mnGN","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd C:/Users/mkdol/dolla/res && node -e \"\nconst content = \\`## Vision\nCreate a unified animation system that consolidates the scattered animation utilities, spring functions, and transition components across the video and visualization modules into a single, cohesive animation library with consistent easing, timing, and theming.\n\n## Business Value\n- Eliminates code duplication across 15+ files that implement similar animation patterns\n- Provides consistent animation behavior across all visualizations\n- Reduces bundle size by consolidating duplicate spring/easing implementations\n- Simplifies maintenance when animation behavior needs adjustment\n\n## Scope\n**Included:**\n- Consolidate spring, interpolate, easing functions from useVideoPlayback.ts\n- Merge Transitions.tsx utilities (Crossfade, Slide, Scale, Stagger, etc.)\n- Create unified animation hooks for common patterns\n- Add theme-aware animation variants\n\n**Out of scope:**\n- Rewriting visualization logic\n- Changing Framer Motion dependency\n\n## Key Components\n1. src/lib/animation/spring.ts - Consolidated spring physics\n2. src/lib/animation/easing.ts - All easing curves in one place  \n3. src/lib/animation/hooks.ts - useSpring, useStagger, useReveal hooks\n4. src/lib/animation/transitions.tsx - Theme-aware transition components\n\n## Technical Approach\n1. Extract all animation utilities from useVideoPlayback.ts into dedicated animation module\n2. Refactor Transitions.tsx components to use the shared utilities\n3. Create React hooks that wrap animation primitives with theme awareness\n4. Update video components to import from new centralized location\n5. Update visualization components to use consistent animation patterns\n\n## Files to Modify\n- src/components/report/video/useVideoPlayback.ts - Extract animation functions\n- src/components/report/video/Transitions.tsx - Refactor to use shared utilities\n- src/components/report/video/AnimatedCharts.tsx - Use shared spring\n- src/components/report/visualizations/Timeline.tsx - Use shared transitions\n- src/components/report/visualizations/NetworkGraph.tsx - Use shared animation hooks\n- Create new src/lib/animation/ directory with consolidated modules\n\n## Success Criteria\n- [ ] All animation utilities live in one place\n- [ ] Zero duplicate spring/easing implementations across codebase\n- [ ] All visualization components use shared animation hooks\n- [ ] Animation timing is consistent across all visualizations\n\n## Potential Challenges\n- Framer Motion and custom spring implementations may have subtle differences - test thoroughly\n- Some components may have bespoke timing requirements - provide escape hatches\\`;\n\nconst http = require('http');\nconst payload = JSON.stringify({\n  project_id: 'b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829',\n  context_map_id: 'group_1769727411820_9razuf0',\n  context_map_title: 'Data Visualizations',\n  context_group_id: 'group_1769727411820_9razuf0',\n  context_name: 'Data Visualizations',\n  source_scan_type: 'refactor',\n  summary: 'Unify animation utilities into shared library with hooks and theming',\n  direction: content\n});\n\nconst req = http.request({\n  hostname: 'localhost',\n  port: 3000,\n  path: '/api/directions',\n  method: 'POST',\n  headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'Content-Length': Buffer.byteLength(payload) }\n}, res => {\n  let data = '';\n  res.on('data', chunk => data += chunk);\n  res.on('end', () => console.log(data));\n});\nreq.write(payload);\nreq.end();\n\"","description":"Create direction 1 via Node.js http"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1018,"cache_read_input_tokens":87808,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1018},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"86fbfc1a-4772-433d-bdd8-8a7ad125f24a","uuid":"1bb29210-bfb8-4bd5-b655-b55db40ad275"}
